ye you know we traditionally think of  it as a disease of aging or maybe  related to hormonal changes but i'm  seeing this in my 20 30 and 40 year olds  um possibly it has something to do with  our digital lifestyle you know whether  you're at work or at home we're  constantly on screens and and using our  eyes  um in different ways than we have in the  past  when patients come in and ask about what  they can use for dry eye relief i like  to recommend sustained complete  preservative-free lubricating eye drops  it's really important to choose a  preservative-free artificial tear  preservatives can be toxic to the  surface of the eye  i'd encourage everyone out there to try  sustain complete preservative free  lubricating eye drop because a single  drop has been shown to provide up to  eight hours of lasting relief and you  know patients uh whether they uh  realize it or not you know we're busy  and people don't like to put things in  their eyes all the time and so it's nice  to choose something that has long  lasting relief  okay well thank you so much and of  course i'm sure you recommend that  people see their eye doctor if it  persists we'll have a link where people  can get more information thank you so  much dr gupto we appreciate your time  this morning
 

